  "title": "Product Tank Tallinn 🚀🤖",
  "date": "2025-09-22T21:00:00.000Z",
  "content": "Product Tank Tallinn 🚀🤖\n\nYesterday, I went to Microsoft for Product Tank Tallinn. The topic this time: How to use LLMs in product management. From copilots 🧑‍✈️ to agents 🤝, the discussions were buzzing. During Q\\&A, someone introduced me to Linear — honestly feels like Jira, but on steroids 💉⚡.\n\nAnd guess what? Every single time I visit Microsoft... it’s magically a sunny day 🌞✨. Either I’m really lucky or the building has a secret weather API.\n\n\n\nSpotted the Skype logo 👀.\nKinda sad it’s gone 💔, but let’s be honest — as a communication tool, it’s like bringing a floppy disk to a cloud conference ☁️😂. Still, the logo looks so mordern.\n\n\n\nAlso found a self-serve weighing machine ⚖️. For a second, I thought I was back in Shenzhen 🇨🇳.\n\n\n\nTallinn tech events never disappoint. Free knowledge, sunny weather, and random office gym vibes 💪😂.",
